        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. In the event of layoff an officially-designated Senior Steward, who has been certified to the Employer in writing, shall have preferential Seniority in the grade of his or her job classification in the Business Unit and on the shift where assigned to work.",
            "block_bbox": [
