        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Preferential seniority, as described in Sections C.1. and 2. above, shall be applicable only when the Steward meets the following qualifications at the time layoff occurs:",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                679,
                736,
                734
