            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. His or her present Steward certification has been in effect for a period of thirty (30) calendar days or more. This paragraph 3.b. does not apply to those incumbent Stewards whose term of office is extended by re-election or appointment.",
