        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. It is agreed that Stewards have full time job duties to perform as employees, and that they shall keep at a minimum the time spent in handling grievances. Department Stewards and/or their alternates shall be compensated by the Employer for time spent in handling grievances during regular scheduled working hours up to a combined maximum of seven (7) total hours per week. Such time shall be accurately recorded by the Steward or his/her alternate as appropriate.",
